# Springtale Docker build-context exclusions.
#
# Without this file, `COPY . .` in the builder stage pulls every file in
# the repo into the build context — including multi-gigabyte `target/`
# directories, the `.git/` history, every connector's `node_modules/`,
# and (most importantly for the threat model) any local `secrets/`,
# `data/vault.bin`, or `.env*` files that a developer might have lying
# around. Those layers get cached on the build host and CI runner —
# pre-emptive exclusion is the only way to stop them entering the
# build cache in the first place.
#
# Aligned with NIST SP 800-190 §4.1 (minimize image attack surface) +
# Springtale's local-first threat model (vault material must never
# enter a Docker layer).

# ── Rust build artifacts ──────────────────────────────────────────
target/
**/target/
**/*.rs.bk
fuzz/target/
fuzz/artifacts/
fuzz/corpus/

# ── Git ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.git/
.gitignore
.gitattributes
.gitleaks.toml
.gitmodules

# ── Node / pnpm ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
**/node_modules/
**/.pnpm-store/
**/.npm/
**/pnpm-debug.log

# ── Tauri frontend build outputs ──────────────────────────────────
tauri/apps/desktop/dist/
tauri/apps/dashboard/dist/
tauri/apps/desktop/src-tauri/target/
tauri/apps/desktop/src-tauri/gen/

# ── Local data + secrets — NEVER ship into a layer ────────────────
# Any local dev run will create these; we COPY . . in the builder so
# they would otherwise land in the builder layer cache.
secrets/
data/
**/*.bin
**/vault.bin
**/vault.bin.tmp
**/springtale.db
**/springtale.db-wal
**/springtale.db-shm
**/springtale.sock
.env
.env.*

# ── IDE / editor scratch ──────────────────────────────────────────
.vscode/
.idea/
.cursor/
**/*.swp
**/*.swo
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db

# ── CI artifacts ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
sbom/
sboms/
mlbom/
cbom/
*.sarif
*.cdx.json
*.spdx.json
*.cosign.bundle

# ── Docs / examples (not needed inside the runtime image) ─────────
docs/
README.md
CHANGELOG.md
CONTRIBUTING.md
SECURITY.md
docker-compose.yml
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
.github/

# ── Misc dev scratch ──────────────────────────────────────────────
*.log
*.tmp
*~
.claude/
.claude-cache/
